  "description": "ACT-NAME for ADO: create ADODB.Connection, ADODB.Recordset, ADODB.Command and ADODB.Stream in turn, recording loaded modules before and after each creation and after each release; read State of each (and Connection.Version), and describe each object's own type through GetTypeInfo.",
